】\n虚构回应甲：…\n虚构回应乙：…\n依据：#编号\n待确认：…？\n【A建议】\n…\n【B对白】\n虚构回应甲：…\n虚构回应乙：…\n依据：#编号\n待确认：…？\n【B建议】\n…\n【C对白】\n虚构回应甲：…\n虚构回应乙：…\n依据：#编号\n待确认：…？\n【C建议】\n…\n本次数据字段顺序为：消息列表、本人想说的话、表达目标、补充边界。只依据这些数据填充上述格式：[[[1,\"明早9点出发，预算500。\"],[2,\"中午才能走。\"],[3,\"希望当天回来。\"],[4,\"先定人数，不要发消息。\"]],\"先确认时间再讨论？\",\"先澄清条件\",\"\"]"},"revision":2,"at":1791790932.6631632},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.verified_own_use_gate","service":"octos.turn.start","request_index":11,"at":1791790932.663186,"revision_before":2},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.verified_own_use_gate","service":"matrix.room_info","payload":{},"revision":2,"at":1791790932.6655629},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.verified_own_use_gate","service":"matrix.room_info","request_index":12,"at":1791790932.665583,"revision_before":2},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.verified_own_use_gate","service":"matrix.read_messages","payload":{"limit":30},"revision":2,"at":1791790932.6656055},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.verified_own_use_gate","service":"matrix.read_messages","request_index":13,"at":1791790932.6656084,"revision_before":2},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.room_info","payload":{},"revision":3,"at":1791790932.699947},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.room_info","request_index":0,"at":1791790932.6999516,"revision_before":3},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.account_info","payload":{},"revision":3,"at":1791790932.6999738},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.account_info","request_index":1,"at":1791790932.6999772,"revision_before":3},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.read_messages","payload":{"limit":30},"revision":3,"at":1791790932.7000053},{"kind":"deliver","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":"matrix.read_messages","request_index":2,"at":1791790932.700008,"revision_before":3},{"kind":"request","case_id":"send.explicit_metadata","service":